<title>SRI LANKA: Kegalle nine-month net sharply up.</title>
<headline>Kegalle nine-month net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Kegalle Plantations Ltd, for the nine months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in million of rupes unless stated):</p>
<p>		     9 months 1996	  9 months 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	511.09	 vs	416.95</p>
<p>     Net profit     64.72	 vs	 45.14</p>
<p>NOTE - Kegalle Plantations, one of the estate firms privatised in late 1995, performed well in 1996 due to high world market prices of Sri Lanka tea, analysts said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
